    213  3dd1							; OFF. VIBRATO or GLIDE held turns on what's off (the ADVANCED SOUND values;
    214  3dd1							; a held VIBRATO has no delay); TAPE WOBBLE held: a deep slow vibrato, each
    215  3dd1							; voice its own phase; WIDE held: the detune about twice as wide.
