------- FILE main.asm
------- FILE attack.asm LEVEL 2 PASS 3
      0  7332					      include	"attack.asm"
      1  7332							; Fat Chip 64 - BEND IN, BEND OUT (v0.30; v0.41: ATTACK folded into BEND IN):
      2  7332							; how each note starts and ends in pitch
      3  7332							;
      4  7332							; BEND IN: each new note starts AMOUNT semitones away (above: a drop, below:
      5  7332							;   a scoop) and comes to its pitch over TIME. SLIDE: the SID and NES slide
      6  7332							;   it (the SID per voice, the NES with its glide), the Game Boy has its own
      7  7332							;   pitch envelope (CC 80 / 81). STEP: the SID and NES hold it there for TIME,
      8  7332							;   then jump (the chip-tune BLIP); the Game Boy slides as fast as it can.
      9  7332							;   CLICK (the SID): the start of each note as noise: SHORT 20 ms, LONG
     10  7332							;   (v0.42) as long as TIME.
     11  7332							; BEND OUT (the SID): a note let go sags AMOUNT semitones over TIME while its
     12  7332							;   release rings.
     13  7332
